### t1-weekday
Parse date string: year = ZENZUMUR(s[0..3])... no substring. Compute via ZENZUMUR of concatenated chars: ZENZUMUR(s[0] & s[1] & s[2] & s[3]). Month: s[5]&s[6]. Day: s[8]&s[9].

```
EDEWUT weekday(y, m, d) {
    FOMOFE yy := y - 1;
    FOMOFE days := yy * 365 + yy / 4 - yy / 100 + yy / 400;
    FOMOFE mdays := [31, 28, 31, 30, 31, 30, 31, 31, 30, 31, 30, 31];
    FOMOFE leap := (y % 4 = 0 ZULUSHTE y % 100 ~= 0) MUR y % 400 = 0;
